# Netlify SPA rewrites: every route serves the app shell with HTTP 200 so
# deep links (single-location, business-profile, announcement,
# campus-history, signup, subscription, download, tutorials) cold-load
# directly. Human traffic always gets the SPA; the edge function only
# rewrites OG tags for crawler user-agents.
# Static verification files must bypass the SPA fallback.
# Netlify serves existing dist files first, but be explicit for crawlers.
/app-ads.txt          /app-ads.txt    200
/single-location/*    /index.html   200
/business-profile/*   /index.html   200
/announcement/*       /index.html   200
/campus-history/*     /index.html   200
/signup               /index.html   200
/subscription         /index.html   200
/download             /index.html   200
/tutorials            /index.html   200
/tutorials/*          /index.html   200
/*    /index.html   200
